---
import { values } from '../../content/portfolio';
---

<section class="section section--about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="about-grid section-shell reveal">
    <aside>
      <h2 class="about-title" id="about-title">I steer the product.</h2>
      <div class="values-list mono-text">
        <span class="values-label">VALUES</span>
        <div class="values-copy">
          {values.map((value) => <span>{value}</span>)}
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="about-primary">
        Hi, I’m Kelly. Product Engineer in Honolulu. I design systems and use AI to build them.
      </p>
      <p class="about-secondary">
        Every project starts as a spec detailed enough for AI to implement. I make the architecture calls, AI produces the code, and I verify, test, and ship it. I do that with Qoder IDE, Factory Droid, Zed, or Windsurf (Devin) for code, Aura.build, Magicpath, and Kombai for design, and a local AI stack I run myself that powers Hermes and OpenJarvis, two agents I use daily.
      </p>
      <p class="about-secondary">
        Off-screen I experiment with plant-based recipes the same way I work through code: change one thing, test it, keep what works. I watch anime for the visual storytelling, which is where a lot of my UI instincts come from. I follow football for the chess match underneath the game, the schemes, the adjustments, and for the fun of watching with friends and family!
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
